                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s32IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>اِلَيْهِ يُرَدُّ عِلمُ السَّاعَةِ وَمَا تَخْرُجُ مِنْ ثَمَرَتٍ مِنْ اَكْمَامِهَا</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#12r">-12r</locus>
فَلِلَّهِ الحَمْدُ رَبِّ السَّمَوَتِ وَرَبِّ الأَرْضِ رَبِّ العَالَمِيْنَ وَلَهُ الكِبْرِيَأُ فِيْ السَّمَوَتِ وَالأَرْضِ وَهْوَ العَزِيْزُ الحَكِيْمُ
</explicit>
                     <note>41:47-45:37. Titles of suras rubricated. Verse markers: red triple dots, single drops filled with red or red and black dot. Words completed on the following line. Words at the end of the line completed vertically to follow the margin line. Deletions. Few corrections in the margins. Noticeable correction f. 3v: a piece of rectangular paper was pasted on the matn, and the correct version rewritten, then the word 'bayt' in red ink is repeatedly written to fill out the remaining space. In the margin, 'ǧuz’ marker in red on fol. 1v and ḥizb marker in red on fol. 6v. </note>
                     <note/>
